# What bench-agents-sync installs from gjcourt/agents into ~/.claude in every
# bench-cloud pod. Reviewed here (homelab), not in the agents repo, so an agent
# change to gjcourt/agents can't widen what gets installed.
#
# Deliberately NOT here: memory (George's personal notes — agents read the open
# web, so prompt-injection exposure), the life agents (coach, chef, trainer,
# tutor, editor, family-office), valet / coach-* / collections-scan (need Gmail
# or the life repo), gstack (needs Chrome), settings/hooks/MCP.
#
# kind       name            path in gjcourt/agents
claude-md    -               cluster/CLAUDE.md
skill        babysit         babysit
skill        critique        critique
skill        ci              ci
skill        deploy-verify   bench/skills/deploy-verify
agent        bench           bench/AGENT.md
agent        webscout        webscout/AGENT.md
